# Public repository guard

This repository is public. Before any commit:

- Never commit real people's names, photos, prayer requests, phones, addresses
- Never commit bank accounts, payment QR codes, or live payment details
- Never commit `data/local/`, `data/uploads/`, `slides*/`, `*.pptx`/`*.potx`, local DBs, or `.env`
- Private registry override: `data/local/default-registry.json` (gitignored)
- If `tests/public-repo-guard.test.mjs` fails, fix the content — do not weaken the test

Full constitution: `.constitution/public-repository.md` and `docs/PRIVATE-DATA.md`.

The legacy repo `bic-pptx-workflow` is frozen; develop only here (`worship-presenter-web`).
